Derived mHC kernel (Apache-2.0)
------------------------------

`p7/mhc_quant/kernel/mhc_post_norm_sm120.cu` and
`p7/mhc_quant/kernel/mhc_post_norm_sm120.py` are modified derivatives of
vLLM-Moet:

- tools/dsv41_sm120/mhc_overlap/mhc_post_norm_sm120.cu
  blob 13ec2c97631ce020cc194354ef8e008af696a21d
- tools/dsv41_sm120/mhc_overlap/mhc_post_norm_sm120.py
  blob e2c58328b1c32c3e6b7524b87c51714ae5f7b820

QMesh changes: removed the optional peer-to-peer all-reduce consumer (the
`kAR` path, `ar_*` arguments, and `p2p_allreduce_sm120` call); added the
MXFP8/UE8M0 quantization epilogue (`mhc_post_norm_quant`) and its swizzled
scale output; adapted the Python wrapper and the `mhc_post_norm` signature.
The upstream file implements the behavior of vLLM's TileLang mHC kernels and
references vLLM-Moet's `mhc_pre_norm_sm120.cu`. The QMesh files are
